<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks rose, one fell and seven were flat in 6.6-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,625.7 points, 1.3 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units also rose 1.3 percent in a 23.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
</text>
